OL,3,AAnalysis: Trump's shock Russia deal
OL,4,Ahighlights mounting pressure to curb
OL,5,Afuel prices
OL,6,
OL,7,FDonald Trump's decision to import
OL,8,FRussian fuel to the US represents a
OL,9,Fremarkable about-face from the
OL,10,Fpresident.
OL,12,FJust three weeks ago, Trump signed
OL,13,Flegislation to authorise fresh American
OL,14,Fsanctions and tariffs on nations that
OL,15,Fimport Russian oil and gas.
OL,17,FNow, Trump says, Russian President
OL,18,FVladimir Putin has agreed to supply
OL,19,Fhundreds of thousands of tons of diesel
OL,20,Ffuel to the US and world markets in the
OL,21,Fcoming months.
OL,23,APub: 09-OctQpppppppppppppppppppppG13/39
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
